---

<Layout title={pageTitle} description={pageDescription} modDatetime={new Date("2026-06-09T00:00:00Z")} structuredData={schemaGraph}>
  <Header />

  <main id="main-content" class="flex w-full flex-1 flex-col items-center">
    <section class="relative flex w-full flex-col items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-[#0f172a] pt-20 pb-24 text-white lg:pt-28 lg:pb-32" style="background-image: radial-gradient(circle at top right, rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.2), transparent 45%), radial-gradient(circle at bottom left, rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.15), transparent 45%);">
      <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl px-4 text-center sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="mb-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-white/20 bg-white/10 px-4 py-1.5 text-sm font-semibold text-blue-100 shadow-sm">
          <span>YMYL-safe eligibility guide • Last updated {displayDate}</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="mx-auto max-w-5xl text-4xl leading-tight font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">
          Free Tablet Eligibility 2026: <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-300 to-blue-100 bg-clip-text text-transparent">EBT, Medicaid, SNAP & Income</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-4xl text-lg leading-relaxed font-medium text-blue-100 sm:text-xl">
          You may qualify for Lifeline-supported service or related free/low-cost tablet options if your household meets income rules or participates in qualifying programs such as SNAP/EBT, Medicaid, SSI, Federal Public Housing Assistance, Veterans Pension, or Survivors Benefit. A tablet is not guaranteed. Device availability depends on provider stock, ZIP code, state rules, documents, shipping, activation, plan terms, and possible co-pay.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-4 sm:flex-row">
          <a href="#quick-answer" class="inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-blue-600 px-8 py-4 text-lg font-bold text-white shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:bg-blue-500 sm:w-auto">Check Eligibility</a>
          <a href="/how-to-apply/" class="inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-white/30 bg-white/5 px-8 py-4 text-lg font-bold text-white backdrop-blur-sm transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-white/10 sm:w-auto">Apply Now</a>
          <a href="#compare-providers" class="inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-white/30 bg-white/5 px-8 py-4 text-lg font-bold text-white backdrop-blur-sm transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-white/10 sm:w-auto">Compare Providers</a>
        </div>
        <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-3xl text-xs leading-relaxed text-blue-200/70">FreeTablet.click is an independent informational guide. We are not the FCC, USAC, Lifeline, National Verifier, a government agency, or a wireless provider. We do not approve applications, issue benefits, or ship devices.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="quick-answer" class="w-full border-b border-border bg-blue-50/60 py-14">
      <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="rounded-3xl border border-blue-100 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm sm:p-8 lg:p-10">
          <p class="mb-3 text-sm font-bold tracking-wide text-blue-600 uppercase">Quick Answer</p>
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-foreground sm:text-4xl">Quick Answer: Who Qualifies for a Free or Low-Cost Tablet in 2026?</h2>
          <div class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-foreground/80">
            <p>Most people qualify through Lifeline eligibility routes, not a single nationwide “free tablet for everyone” program. You may qualify if your household participates in SNAP/EBT, Medicaid, SSI, Federal Public Housing Assistance, Veterans Pension, Survivors Benefit, certain Tribal programs, or if your income is at or below 135% of the Federal Poverty Guidelines.</p>
            <p>Tablet offers are not guaranteed and depend on provider availability, state/ZIP-code rules, documents, inventory, shipping, activation, and possible co-pay. Learn how to <a href="/how-to-apply/" class="font-bold text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700">apply for a free tablet online</a>, <a href="/states/" class="font-bold text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700">check tablet availability by state</a>, compare the <a href="/" class="font-bold text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700">free government tablet guide</a>, and review <a href="/airtalk-wireless/" class="font-bold text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700">AirTalk Wireless eligibility</a>, <a href="/assurance-wireless/" class="font-bold text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700">Assurance Wireless eligibility</a>, <a href="/safelink-wireless/" class="font-bold text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700">SafeLink Wireless eligibility</a>, and <a href="/standup-wireless/" class="font-bold text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700">StandUp Wireless eligibility</a>.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="official-resources" class="w-full bg-white py-12">
      <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-muted/20 p-6 shadow-sm sm:p-8">
