    <section id="lifeline-vs-tablet" class="w-full bg-white py-16 lg:py-24">
      <div class="mx-auto grid w-full max-w-7xl grid-cols-1 gap-10 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:px-8">
        <div class="lg:col-span-5"><p class="mb-3 text-sm font-bold tracking-wide text-blue-600 uppercase">Important distinction</p><h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-foreground sm:text-4xl">Lifeline vs Tablet Availability</h2></div>
        <div class="space-y-5 lg:col-span-7"><p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-foreground/75">Lifeline is primarily a phone or internet discount/service support program. A tablet may be offered by some providers or local programs when available, but Lifeline eligibility alone does not guarantee a tablet.</p><p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-foreground/75">Users should verify provider stock, device model, service plan, activation, shipping, possible co-pay, and state/ZIP-code availability before submitting personal information or documents.</p></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="income" class="w-full border-y border-border bg-slate-50 py-16 lg:py-24">
      <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
